[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6361.75, "timestamp": "01:46:01", "text": "与我们一起玩游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6363.27, "timestamp": "01:46:03", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6364.629, "timestamp": "01:46:04", "text": "谢谢你们邀请我和我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6366.79, "timestamp": "01:46:06", "text": "恶作剧来参加。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6368.229, "timestamp": "01:46:08", "text": "感谢你今天帮我处理这些小麻烦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6375.51, "timestamp": "01:46:15", "text": "谢谢。 谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6376.31, "timestamp": "01:46:16", "text": "我也玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6379.43, "timestamp": "01:46:19", "text": "得很开心，兄弟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6381.51, "timestamp": "01:46:21", "text": "太棒了，兄弟。 太棒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6383.51, "timestamp": "01:46:23", "text": "我们也拍了很多视频片段。 所以，就像是……的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6384.55, "timestamp": "01:46:24", "text": "内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6386.31, "timestamp": "01:46:26", "text": "，当然。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6388.07, "timestamp": "01:46:28", "text": "真正的。   当然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6389.109, "timestamp": "01:46:29", "text": "。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6389.66, "timestamp": "01:46:29", "author": "@Anshikaa-0ok", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/TpeznIQ2yHK6m0yofUjDvHTiYNjCZYhnen9pplJLGn4RRsUvCKplgQzxRgGHZZr4CVUpYpK4=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Bye have a nice day"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6390.55, "timestamp": "01:46:30", "text": "这是适合所有人的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6393.43, "timestamp": "01:46:33", "text": "我死了好多次，但我仍然玩得很开心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6394.47, "timestamp": "01:46:34", "text": "没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6397.75, "timestamp": "01:46:37", "text": "你太棒了。 你真是太酷了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6400.79, "timestamp": "01:46:40", "text": "兄弟，你是这场比赛的命脉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6402.229, "timestamp": "01:46:42", "text": "字面上地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6404.149, "timestamp": "01:46:44", "text": "真的吗？   是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6405.51, "timestamp": "01:46:45", "text": "，兄弟。   随便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6408.709, "timestamp": "01:46:48", "text": "问问别人就知道了，兄弟。 随便问问谁。 好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6410.87, "timestamp": "01:46:50", "text": "吉野学长。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6413.27, "timestamp": "01:46:53", "text": "Kai当时不是也在场吗？嗯。 是的。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6414.629, "timestamp": "01:46:54", "text": "凯，你是团队的支柱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6417.27, "timestamp": "01:46:57", "text": "我刚开始玩的时候，连"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6419.59, "timestamp": "01:46:59", "text": "怎么捡枪都不会，而她却能"}]